:"A perfectly symmetric unimodal normal distribution has equal mean, median and mode."},"references":[],"review":"original_key_excluded_independently_reasoned_curated_option_review","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"keyVerified":false,"questionTextHash":"d2cab95c847ee54bd6d58243b2968bcf6625d13a831bad798e82190cfd7bb1b9","answerFormat":"single_best_answer"},"q-e45804750e6c":{"correct":"D","answerText":"Blood glucose level","explanation":"Blood glucose concentration is a continuous measurement, while numbers of visits, pregnancies and cigarettes are counts.","optionReasons":{"D":"Blood glucose concentration is a continuous measurement, while numbers of visits, pregnancies and cigarettes are counts."},"references":[],"review":"original_key_excluded_independently_reasoned_curated_option_review","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"keyVerified":false,"questionTextHash":"4f58ffcc3881002e1bc224899b7bd6495ceadcc1e74e76705379fc9f3d2d2888","answerFormat":"single_best_answer"},"q-96f00b88b5a8":{"correct":"D","answerText":"Quantitative and qualitative.","explanation":"Broad methodological research approaches are quantitative (numeric measurement) and qualitative (interpretive study of experiences/meanings).","optionReasons":{"D":"Broad methodological research approaches are quantitative (numeric measurement) and qualitative (interpretive study of experiences/meanings)."},"references":[],"review":"original_key_excluded_independently_reasoned_curated_option_review","reviewDate":"2026-10-20","provisional":true,"sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"keyVerified":false,"questionTextHash":"42430d7cf82cc822d06083c6c6e28ef2c99e8af774dc6cb4b7d59589f20584f9","answerFormat":"single_best_answer"},"q-cb22d7119cd5":{"correct":"B","answerText":"Range","explanation":"Range is a measure of spread, not central tendency; mean, median and mode all describe typical location.","optionReasons":{"B":"Range is a measure of spread, not ce